        // LegalDocumentsDialog.kt
        "1. Scope & Data Controller (Updated: November 2026)" to "1. Geltungsbereich & Verantwortlicher (Stand: November 2026)",
        "This Privacy Policy explains how Finsay (finsayapp.com, package com.kynigos.oikonomos) collects, uses, processes, stores, and protects your personal and financial tracking data. It is designed to comply with the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR 2016/679), Greek Law 4624/2019, the UK GDPR, applicable United States privacy statutes (including the California CCPA/CPRA, Virginia VCDPA, Colorado CPA, Connecticut CTDPA, and Texas TDPSA), and Google Play Developer Program Policies. Data Controller contact: support@finsayapp.com." to "Diese Datenschutzerklärung erläutert, wie Finsay (finsayapp.com, Paket com.kynigos.oikonomos) deine personenbezogenen und finanziellen Daten gemäß DSGVO (EU 2016/679), griechischem Gesetz 4624/2019, UK GDPR, geltenden US-Datenschutzgesetzen (CCPA/CPRA u. a.) und Google-Play-Richtlinien verarbeitet und schützt. Kontakt: support@finsayapp.com.",
        "2. Categories of Data Collected & Profile Isolation" to "2. Erfasste Daten & Profil-Isolation",
        "• Account & Authentication Data: Name, email address, unique user identifier (UID), and profile photo obtained via Google Sign-In (Android Credential Manager) or Email/Password through Firebase Authentication.\n• Private Profile Details (Strictly Owner-Only): Optional fields such as phone number, date of birth, occupation, and city are isolated in a private sub-document readable and writable exclusively by your authenticated account—never exposed to other users during ledger-sharing lookups.\n• Financial & Budget Records: Amounts, titles/descriptions, categories, dates, payment sources, selected ledger currency, incomes, monthly budgets, recurring bills, savings goals, and member split/settle-up entries voluntarily logged by you.\n• Shared Household Data: Member nicknames, roles (Creator, Editor, Registar), shared ledger links, and an activity log of ledger edits visible to authorized members of that ledger.\n• Preferences & Local Settings: Language (EL/EN), theme mode, reminder schedules, and local merchant-to-category memory." to "• Konto & Anmeldung: Name, E-Mail, eindeutige UID und Profilfoto über Google Sign-In oder E-Mail/Passwort via Firebase Authentication.\n• Privates Profil (nur Eigentümer): Optionale Angaben wie Telefon, Geburtsdatum, Beruf und Stadt liegen isoliert in einem privaten Unterdokument — niemals sichtbar für andere Nutzer.\n• Finanzdaten: Beträge, Titel, Kategorien, Daten, Währung, Einnahmen, Budgets, Daueraufträge, Sparziele und Aufteilungen.\n• Geteilte Bücher: Mitgliedsnamen, Rollen (Ersteller, Bearbeiter, Erfasser), Freigaben und Änderungsverlauf für berechtigte Mitglieder.\n• Lokale Einstellungen: Sprache, Design, Erinnerungszeiten und lokaler Händler-Speicher.",
        "3. Bank & Wallet Push Notification Reader (Optional, 100% On-Device)" to "3. Bank- & Wallet-Benachrichtigungen (Optional, 100 % lokal)",
        "• Strictly Opt-In: The Bank Notification Auto-Catcher (Android NotificationListenerService) is completely disabled by default. It activates ONLY after you review our in-app Prominent Disclosure and manually grant Notification Access in Android System Settings.\n• Strict Filtering & On-Device Parsing: Finsay filters solely for recognized banking and digital wallet notification packages (ignoring personal messages, chats, emails, and OTP/2FA codes). Merchant name and transaction amount are parsed 100% locally in device memory.\n• Zero Transmission & Explicit Save: Raw notification text is NEVER uploaded to Finsay servers, logged externally, or shared with third parties. Detected alerts create a local draft only; an expense is saved and synced to the cloud ONLY if you actively tap Save/Confirm.\n• No Bank Credentials / No Open Banking: Finsay never collects banking logins, passwords, card numbers, PINs, or PSD2/Open Banking tokens.\n• Revocation: You may disable this feature anytime in App Settings or Android System Settings." to "• Freiwilliges Opt-In: Standardmäßig deaktiviert; wird erst aktiv, nachdem du den Benachrichtigungszugriff in Android manuell erlaubst.\n• Strenge Filterung & lokale Verarbeitung: Nur erkannte Bank-/Wallet-Pushs werden lokal ausgewertet (SMS, Chats, E-Mails & OTP-Codes werden ignoriert).\n• Keine Übertragung: Rohtexte werden nie hochgeladen oder geteilt. Erst nach deinem Bestätigen wird ein Eintrag gespeichert.\n• Keine Bank-Zugangsdaten: Finsay erfasst niemals Bank-Logins, Kartennummern, PINs oder PSD2-Tokens.\n• Widerruf: Jederzeit in den App- oder Android-Einstellungen deaktivierbar.",
        "4. Camera, Receipt OCR, AADE/e-Invoicing QR Lookup & Voice Entry" to "4. Kamera, Beleg-OCR, AADE-QR & Spracheingabe",
        "• Camera & Photo Picker: Camera access (CAMERA) or the zero-permission Android Photo Picker is used solely when you choose to scan a receipt or QR code. OCR text recognition and barcode decoding run locally on-device via Google ML Kit; receipt images are not uploaded to Finsay servers.\n• Greek AADE / e-Invoicing QR Verification: When you scan a Greek tax/e-invoicing QR code, the app may perform a direct, read-only HTTPS lookup strictly to allowlisted official tax/e-invoicing domains (e.g., aade.gr and certified Greek e-invoicing providers) solely to retrieve merchant name, VAT/AFM, date, and total amount.\n• Voice Expense Entry (RECORD_AUDIO): Used only when you press the microphone button. Speech-to-text relies on Android's native SpeechRecognizer service (subject to your device/Google speech service terms), and the resulting text is parsed locally into a draft expense. Finsay does NOT record, save, or upload audio files." to "• Kamera & Fotoauswahl: Nur beim Scannen von Belegen/QR-Codes. OCR und Code-Erkennung laufen lokal via Google ML Kit; Bilder werden nicht hochgeladen.\n• AADE-QR-Abfrage: Beim Scannen griechischer Steuer-QR-Codes kann eine reine Lese-HTTPS-Abfrage an offizielle Domains (z. B. aade.gr) für Händler, USt-IdNr., Datum und Betrag erfolgen.\n• Spracheingabe (RECORD_AUDIO): Nur beim Tippen aufs Mikrofon über Android SpeechRecognizer. Finsay speichert oder überträgt keine Audiodateien.",
        "5. Biometric App Lock, Local Merchant Memory & Device Features" to "5. Biometrische Sperre, lokaler Speicher & Gerätefunktionen",
        "• Optional Biometric & PIN App Lock: Fingerprint/Face Unlock uses Android BiometricPrompt handled exclusively by your device's secure OS hardware. Finsay NEVER accesses, collects, stores, or transmits biometric identifiers or templates (compliant with GDPR Art. 9 and US state biometric laws such as BIPA/CUBI). Any optional 4-digit PIN is stored strictly on-device as a salted SHA-256 hash.\n• Smart Merchant Category Memory: Category corrections for merchants/VAT IDs are stored locally on-device (SharedPreferences) solely to improve auto-suggestions.\n• Reminders, Widgets, Quick Tile & App Shortcuts: Local notifications (POST_NOTIFICATIONS, RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED, WAKE_LOCK, VIBRATE) deliver user-configured reminders and bank-draft prompts. Widgets, Quick Settings tiles, and launcher App Shortcuts operate locally." to "• Biometrie & PIN: Fingerabdruck/Face ID läuft ausschließlich über Android BiometricPrompt. Finsay speichert niemals biometrische Daten. Eine optionale PIN wird nur lokal als gesalzener SHA-256-Hash abgelegt.\n• Händler-Speicher: Kategorie-Korrekturen bleiben lokal auf deinem Gerät.\n• Erinnerungen, Widgets & Kacheln: Lokale Benachrichtigungen und Schnellzugriffe arbeiten rein lokal.",
        "6. Legal Bases (GDPR / UK GDPR), Zero Ads & No Data Selling" to "6. Rechtsgrundlagen (DSGVO), keine Werbung & kein Datenverkauf",
        "• Performance of Contract (Art. 6(1)(b)): Delivering budgeting, multi-currency tracking, analytics, cloud sync, shared ledgers, and data exports.\n• Consent (Art. 6(1)(a)): Mandatory acceptance of these Terms & Privacy Policy (version and timestamp recorded in your private owner-only profile), plus optional bank notification parsing, camera/OCR, microphone voice input, and reminder notifications (withdrawable anytime).\n• Legitimate Interests (Art. 6(1)(f)): Ensuring security, preventing unauthorized access via Firebase Authentication and Zero-Trust Firestore Security Rules, and maintaining service reliability.\n• Zero Ads, No Data Brokers & No Third-Party AI Uploads: Finsay displays no ads, does NOT sell or rent personal data, does NOT share personal data for cross-context behavioral advertising, and does NOT transmit your financial data to third-party cloud LLM/AI services." to "• Vertragserfüllung (Art. 6 Abs. 1 b): Budgetverwaltung, Multi-Währung, Analysen, Cloud-Sync, Teilen und Export.\n• Einwilligung (Art. 6 Abs. 1 a): Zustimmung zu AGB/Datenschutz sowie optionale Funktionen (Bank-Push, OCR, Sprache, Erinnerungen), jederzeit widerrufbar.\n• Berechtigtes Interesse (Art. 6 Abs. 1 f): Kontosicherheit, Zero-Trust-Regeln in Firestore und Betriebsstabilität.\n• Keine Werbung & kein Verkauf: Finsay zeigt keine Werbung, verkauft keine Daten und sendet keine Finanzdaten an externe KI-Dienste.",
        "7. Cloud Infrastructure, Security & International Transfers" to "7. Cloud-Infrastruktur, Sicherheit & Drittlandtransfers",
        "• Crash & Performance Diagnostics: Finsay uses Firebase Crashlytics and Firebase Performance Monitoring solely to detect crashes and improve app responsiveness. Only anonymous technical diagnostics (device model, OS version, stack traces, and app startup/sync timings) are collected—never financial entries, amounts, emails, or personal identifiers." to "• Absturz- & Leistungsdiagnose: Finsay nutzt Firebase Crashlytics und Firebase Performance Monitoring ausschließlich zur Fehlererkennung und Stabilitätsverbesserung. Es werden nur anonyme technische Daten (Gerätemodell, Android-Version, Stack-Traces, Ladezeiten) erfasst — niemals Finanzdaten, Beträge, E-Mails oder persönliche Kennungen.",
        "• Storage & Security: Cloud data is hosted on Google Cloud / Firebase Firestore with TLS encryption in transit, AES encryption at rest, Firebase Authentication, and Zero-Trust Security Rules restricting reads/writes to authorized ledger members.\n• International Data Transfers: Because Google Cloud / Firebase operates global infrastructure (including EU and US servers), any transfers outside the EEA or UK are safeguarded by EU Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs), the UK International Data Transfer Addendum, and Google LLC's certification under the EU-US / UK-US Data Privacy Framework.\n• Google Play Services: Finsay Pro purchases are processed exclusively by Google Play Billing (we never see or store payment card details). Native Google Play In-App Updates and In-App Review APIs may run discreetly under Google's Privacy Policy." to "• Sicherheit: Cloud-Daten liegen bei Google Cloud / Firebase Firestore mit TLS-Transportverschlüsselung, AES-Speicherverschlüsselung und Zero-Trust-Regeln.\n• Internationale Übermittlungen: Abgesichert durch EU-Standardvertragsklauseln (SCC) und das EU-US Data Privacy Framework.\n• Google Play: Finsay Pro-Käufe erfolgen ausschließlich über Google Play Billing; Zahlungsdaten sehen wir nie.",
        "8. Data Retention, Exports & Permanent Account Deletion" to "8. Speicherdauer, Export & Kontolöschung",
        "• Retention: We retain your account and ledger data only for as long as your account remains active or until you delete specific entries or your entire account.\n• Data Portability: You may export your expenses, incomes, balances, and member settle-up summaries to Excel (.xls), PDF (.pdf), or CSV (.csv) locally on-device anytime.\n• Immediate Account Deletion: You may permanently delete your account, private profile, owned ledgers, and cloud/local data directly in the app (Menu (☰) > My Profile > Delete Account) or via https://finsayapp.com/delete-account.html. Residual cloud backups are purged within standard infrastructure cycles (up to 30 days)." to "• Speicherdauer: Solange dein Konto aktiv ist oder bis du Einträge bzw. dein Konto löschst.\n• Datenübertragbarkeit: Exportiere Daten jederzeit als Excel (.xls), PDF (.pdf) oder CSV (.csv).\n• Sofortige Löschung: Lösche dein Konto direkt unter Menü (☰) > Profil > Konto löschen oder über https://finsayapp.com/delete-account.html (Rest-Backups werden binnen max. 30 Tagen gelöscht).",
        "9. Your Rights (Greece, EU/EEA, UK & United States)" to "9. Deine Rechte (EU/EWR, UK & USA)",
        "• Greece, EU/EEA & UK (GDPR / Law 4624/2019 / UK GDPR): You have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict processing, data portability, object, withdraw consent at any time, and lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority—including the Hellenic Data Protection Authority (HDPA, www.dpa.gr) or the UK ICO.\n• United States (California CCPA/CPRA & State Privacy Laws — VA, CO, CT, UT, TX, etc.): US residents have the right to know/access personal information collected, request deletion, request correction of inaccurate data, obtain a portable copy, and receive non-discriminatory treatment when exercising privacy rights. Finsay DOES NOT \"sell\" personal information and DOES NOT \"share\" personal information for cross-context behavioral advertising. Sensitive personal information is used strictly as necessary to provide requested app features.\n• Exercising Rights: Use in-app tools or email support@finsayapp.com; we verify and respond within 30 days (or the statutory period under applicable law)." to "• EU/EWR & UK (DSGVO): Recht auf Auskunft, Berichtigung, Löschung, Einschränkung, Datenübertragbarkeit, Widerspruch, Widerruf und Beschwerde bei einer Aufsichtsbehörde (z. B. HDPA, www.dpa.gr).\n• USA (CCPA/CPRA u. a.): Auskunfts-, Lösch-, Berichtigungs- und Portabilitätsrechte ohne Diskriminierung. Finsay verkauft keine Daten.\n• Ausübung: Über die App oder per E-Mail an support@finsayapp.com (Antwort binnen 30 Tagen).",
        "10. Children's Privacy (COPPA & GDPR Art. 8) & Changes" to "10. Jugendschutz & Änderungen",
        "• Children's Privacy: Finsay is not intended for children under 13 years of age (US COPPA) or under 16 years of age (or the applicable digital consent age in your EU/EEA/UK country under GDPR Art. 8). We do not knowingly collect data from children; contact support@finsayapp.com for immediate deletion if you believe a child provided data.\n• Policy Updates: We may update this Privacy Policy to reflect new features or legal requirements. Material changes will be notified in-app or on finsayapp.com." to "• Minderjährige: Finsay richtet sich nicht an Kinder unter 13 Jahren (COPPA) bzw. unter 16 Jahren in der EU/EWR (oder dem nationalen Mindestalter). Kontaktiere support@finsayapp.com zur sofortigen Löschung.\n• Änderungen: Wesentliche Anpassungen werden in der App oder auf finsayapp.com mitgeteilt.",
        "1. Acceptance of Terms & Eligibility (Updated: November 2026)" to "1. Annahme & Nutzungsberechtigung (Stand: November 2026)",
        "By downloading, installing, registering for, or using Finsay (finsayapp.com), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and our Privacy Policy. You must be at least 16 years old in the EU/EEA/UK (or the applicable legal digital consent age in your jurisdiction) and at least 13 years old in the United States (or have verifiable parental consent where required) to use Finsay. If you do not agree, do not use the application." to "Mit dem Herunterladen oder Nutzen von Finsay (finsayapp.com) akzeptierst du diese Nutzungsbedingungen und die Datenschutzerklärung. Du musst mindestens 16 Jahre alt sein in der EU/EWR/UK (bzw. das gesetzliche Mindestalter erreichen) und mindestens 13 Jahre in den USA.",
        "2. Service Description & Strict Financial / Tax Advice Disclaimer" to "2. Leistungsbeschreibung & kein Finanz-/Steuerrat",
        "Finsay is an informational personal and household expense, income, budget, multi-currency, and split-tracking tool. Finsay DOES NOT provide financial, investment, banking, accounting, legal, or tax advice, nor does it execute payments, currency conversions, or money transfers. Displayed currencies are purely organizational labels; Finsay does not perform regulated foreign-exchange brokerage. You remain solely responsible for verifying all figures, tax obligations, and financial decisions." to "Finsay ist ein informatives Werkzeug zur Haushalts- und Ausgabenverwaltung. Finsay bietet keine Finanz-, Anlage-, Rechts- oder Steuerberatung und führt keine Zahlungen oder Währungsumrechnungen aus. Du bleibst für alle Angaben und Entscheidungen selbst verantwortlich.",
        "3. Bank Notification Reader Disclaimer (No Open Banking / PSD2)" to "3. Hinweis zur Bank-Erkennung (Kein PSD2 / Open Banking)",
        "• Independent Local Utility: The optional Bank Notification Auto-Catcher reads Android payment notifications solely on-device after your explicit system authorization. Finsay is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to any bank, card issuer, or payment institution, and does NOT operate as a PSD2 / Open Banking Account Information Service Provider (AISP) or Payment Initiation Service Provider (PISP).\n• Best-Effort Accuracy: Because banks frequently change notification wording and Android battery/OEM policies may delay or restrict background delivery, Finsay cannot guarantee that every card payment will be detected or parsed with 100% accuracy. You must review and confirm every draft before saving and rely on official bank statements for authoritative records." to "• Lokales Hilfsmittel: Liest Zahlungs-Pushs nach deiner Erlaubnis nur lokal. Finsay ist mit keiner Bank verbunden und kein PSD2-/Open-Banking-Dienstleister.\n• Prüfpflicht: Prüfe jeden Entwurf vor dem Speichern und verlasse dich für verbindliche Angaben auf offizielle Kontoauszüge.",
        "4. Receipt OCR, AADE / e-Invoicing QR Lookup & Voice Entry" to "4. Beleg-OCR, AADE-QR & Spracheingabe",
        "Optical character recognition (OCR), QR receipt lookups (including direct read-only queries to allowlisted Greek tax/e-invoicing portals such as AADE), and voice-to-text parsing are automated convenience features that may occasionally misread text, speech, dates, or totals. Finsay is not affiliated with AADE or any e-invoicing provider. You are solely responsible for checking and correcting auto-filled values against original receipts before saving." to "OCR, QR-Abfragen (inkl. AADE) und Spracheingabe sind Komfortfunktionen mit möglicher Fehlerquote. Finsay ist mit keiner Steuerbehörde verbunden. Prüfe alle automatisch erfassten Werte vor dem Speichern.",
        "5. Shared Households, Member Roles & Third-Party Consent" to "5. Geteilte Bücher, Rollen & Einwilligung Dritter",
        "When creating or participating in a shared ledger (Creator, Editor, Registar), you acknowledge that financial entries, split balances, and ledger activity logs are visible to all authorized members of that ledger according to their roles. You represent and warrant that you have obtained appropriate consent before entering another individual's personal information or inviting them to a shared ledger, and you are responsible for managing member access in ledgers you control." to "Bei geteilten Büchern (Ersteller, Bearbeiter, Erfasser) sind Einträge, Salden und Verlauf für berechtigte Mitglieder sichtbar. Du stellst sicher, die Zustimmung Dritter vor Einladungen eingeholt zu haben.",
        "6. Account Security, Optional App Lock & Data Exports" to "6. Kontosicherheit, App-Sperre & Exporte",
        "• Credentials & Local App Lock: You are responsible for safeguarding your sign-in credentials and device. Optional Biometric/PIN App Lock is a local convenience safeguard; if you forget your PIN or lose device biometric access, recovery may require re-authentication or reinstalling the app.\n• Exported Files: When you export reports (Excel, PDF, CSV) and share them via third-party apps (email, messaging, cloud drives), those exported copies leave Finsay's control and their confidentiality becomes your sole responsibility." to "• Zugangsdaten & Sperre: Schütze deine Zugangsdaten und dein Gerät. Bei vergessener lokaler PIN kann eine Neuanmeldung oder Neuinstallation nötig sein.\n• Exportdateien: Nach dem Export und Teilen (Excel, PDF, CSV) über Dritt-Apps liegt deren Vertraulichkeit in deiner Verantwortung.",
        "7. Finsay Pro Subscriptions, Renewals & Refunds (Google Play)" to "7. Finsay Pro-Abos, Verlängerungen & Erstattungen",
        "• Billing & Auto-Renewal: Certain advanced features (such as Bank Notification Auto-Catcher, multiple ledgers, and unlimited members) require a Finsay Pro subscription or lifetime purchase processed exclusively via Google Play Billing. Recurring subscriptions automatically renew unless cancelled in Google Play settings before the end of the current billing period.\n• Refunds & Consumer Rights: Pricing, cancellations, and refund requests are governed by Google Play's billing policies and applicable mandatory consumer laws in your jurisdiction (including statutory EU/UK withdrawal rights where applicable and US consumer statutes)." to "• Abrechnung: Erweiterte Funktionen erfordern Finsay Pro über Google Play Billing. Abos verlängern sich automatisch, sofern nicht rechtzeitig bei Google Play gekündigt.\n• Erstattungen: Es gelten die Google Play-Richtlinien sowie zwingende gesetzliche Verbraucherrechte.",
        "8. Acceptable Use & Intellectual Property" to "8. Zulässige Nutzung & geistiges Eigentum",
        "You agree not to misuse Finsay, bypass authentication or security rules, attempt unauthorized access to other users' data, reverse-engineer or copy proprietary components except as permitted by mandatory law, or use the app for fraudulent or unlawful purposes. All Finsay trademarks, branding, design, and software remain the intellectual property of Finsay and its creators." to "Du darfst Finsay nicht missbrauchen, Sicherheitsregeln umgehen, auf fremde Daten zugreifen oder geschützte Teile rechtswidrig kopieren. Alle Marken, Designs und Software bleiben Eigentum von Finsay.",
        "9. Disclaimer of Warranties & Limitation of Liability" to "9. Gewährleistung & Haftungsbeschränkung",
        "To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Finsay is provided \"AS IS\" and \"AS AVAILABLE\" without warranties of uninterrupted operation or error-free parsing. To the maximum extent permitted by law, Finsay and its developers shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, special, punitive, or consequential damages, missed bill reminders, unparsed notifications, or loss of profits/data; aggregate liability shall not exceed the total amount paid by you for Finsay Pro during the twelve (12) months preceding the claim.\n• Statutory Carve-Out (EU/UK/US): Nothing in these Terms excludes or limits liability that cannot legally be excluded under mandatory law (including gross negligence, willful misconduct, fraud, or mandatory statutory consumer rights in the EU/EEA, UK, or US states)." to "Soweit gesetzlich zulässig, wird Finsay „WIE BESEHEN“ ohne Garantie auf unterbrechungsfreien Betrieb bereitgestellt. Die Gesamthaftung ist auf den in den letzten 12 Monaten für Finsay Pro gezahlten Betrag begrenzt; zwingende gesetzliche Rechte und Haftung bei Vorsatz/grober Fahrlässigkeit bleiben unberührt.",
        "10. Termination, Changes, Governing Law & International Consumer Rights" to "10. Kündigung, Änderungen & anwendbares Recht",
        "• Termination: You may terminate your account anytime via Menu (☰) > My Profile > Delete Account. We may suspend accounts that materially violate these Terms or threaten platform security.\n• Governing Law & Consumer Carve-Out: These Terms are governed by the laws of the Hellenic Republic (Greece) and applicable European Union law, with disputes submitted to the courts of Athens, Greece. However, if you are a consumer residing in the EU/EEA, the UK, or the United States, nothing in these Terms deprives you of the mandatory consumer protection laws or statutory forum rights of your country or state of residence.\n• Contact: support@finsayapp.com." to "• Kündigung: Du kannst dein Konto jederzeit unter Menü (☰) > Profil > Konto löschen beenden.\n• Recht: Es gilt das Recht der Hellenischen Republik (Griechenland) und EU-Recht (Gerichtsstand Athen); zwingende Verbraucherschutzvorschriften deines Wohnsitzlandes bleiben unberührt.\n• Kontakt: support@finsayapp.com."
    )
}
